{"event": "llm_route", "client_s": 5.897, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 26, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:11.466Z", "t_ms": 5840, "call_site": "synthesize", "agent": "synthesizer", "provider": "gemini-openrouter", "model_id": "google/gemini-3.8-flash", "dimension": "cost", "rationale": "Grounded answer from 1 paper and one worker result; the low-cost model is sufficient.", "features": {"n_tasks": 1, "n_tasks_ok": 1, "n_evidence": 8, "n_papers": 1, "n_web": 0, "n_data": 0, "evidence_tokens_est": 3065, "comparison": false, "statuses": ["done"], "evidence_only": true}, "reasoning_effort": "minimal", "timeout_s": 60.0, "price_checked": "2026-10-27", "decision_id": "d9d17ae3", "provider_label": "Google Gemini (served through OpenRouter)"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.659, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:13.226Z", "t_ms": 7600, "delta": "### Decoding in Toolformer\n\n* **Generation Process and API Interruption:** Tool"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.856, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:13.425Z", "t_ms": 7799, "delta": "former performs standard text decoding until it emits the `→` token, which signals that it expects an API response [C5"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.029, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:13.600Z", "t_ms": 7974, "delta": "]. At this point, decoding is interrupted, the external tool is invoked to obtain a text response $r$, and decoding"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.284, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:13.855Z", "t_ms": 8229, "delta": " resumes after inserting the response followed by the `</API>` closing token [C3, C5].\n* **Modified Greedy Decoding:**"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.566, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:14.136Z", "t_ms": 8510, "delta": " During evaluation on downstream tasks, standard greedy decoding is modified so that the model triggers an API call if `<API>` appears among"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.739, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:14.310Z", "t_ms": 8684, "delta": " the top $k$ most likely tokens rather than only when it is the single most likely token ($k=1$)"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.9, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:14.469Z", "t_ms": 8843, "delta": " [C8]. The authors set $k=10$ to increase the model's likelihood of using tools [C8].\n*"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.161, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:14.704Z", "t_ms": 9078, "delta": " **Call Limit:** Decoding permits at most one API call per input to prevent the model from entering an infinite loop of invoking"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.313, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:14.885Z", "t_ms": 9259, "delta": " APIs without generating output [C8].\n\n### Evaluation on Downstream Tasks\n\n* **Prompted Zero-Shot Setup:** Evaluation across"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.638, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 36, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:15.189Z", "t_ms": 9563, "delta": " downstream tasks is conducted entirely in a zero-shot setting where tasks are described using natural language instructions without dataset-specific demonstration"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.885, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 37, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:15.436Z", "t_ms": 9810, "delta": " examples [C1, C8]. This tests the model's ability to autonomously decide when and how to invoke tools without prior instructions specifying"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.194, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 38, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:15.669Z", "t_ms": 10043, "delta": " tool usage [C5, C8].\n* **Baselines and Tool Disabling:** Toolformer (initialized from GPT-J)"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.254, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:15.828Z", "t_ms": 10202, "delta": " is compared against several baselines [C6, C7]:\n  * Standard GPT-J without finetuning [C7]."}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.476, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 40, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:16.040Z", "t_ms": 10414, "delta": "\n  * GPT-J finetuned on the plain text corpus without API calls (GPT-J + CC) [C7]."}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.727, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 41, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:16.299Z", "t_ms": 10673, "delta": "\n  * A disabled variant, **Toolformer (disabled)**, where API calls are deactivated during decoding [C7].\n  "}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.903, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 42, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:16.474Z", "t_ms": 10848, "delta": "* Substantially larger models, including OPT (66B) and GPT-3 (175B) [C"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.928, "data": {"request_id": "d246819b26da", "seq": 43, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:16.499Z", "t_ms": 10873, "delta": "7]."}}
